[52.4754, "o", "[\u001b[32m OK  \u001b(B\u001b[m] HTTPS /health: OK\r\n[\u001b[32m OK  \u001b(B\u001b[m] Bateria completa: todas as verificações passaram.\r\n\u001b[1m── [16/16] Auditoria de segurança\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
